WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.330
Access. Super admins only.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:13.490
Add someone by the Google email they sign in with, and pick their role. There's always at least one super admin, so nobody locks everyone out.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:31.440
Each role is a set of switches: can edit, manage access, and director contact. Contest H Q can edit and sees director numbers. A spotter sees everything and changes nothing. Need a director liaison? Make a role with just Director contact.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:43.010
Most volunteers get their screen from their shift. For anyone else, a tracker crew gets its own link, with just the steps they tap, and whether they can see the H Q board.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.510
That's the admin guide.
